        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "If it is the opposite gender of the\nuser, the foe is charmed into sharply\nlowering its Sp. Atk stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "platinum",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/9/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "If it is the opposite gender of the\nuser, the foe is charmed into sharply\nlowering its Sp. Atk stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "heartgold-soulsilver",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/10/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur piétine le sol et inflige des\ndégâts à tous les Pokémon autour\nde lui. Baisse aussi la Vitesse.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user stomps down on the ground\nand attacks everything in the area.\nThe targets’ Speed stat is reduced.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user stomps down on the ground\nand attacks everything in the area.\nThe targets’ Speed stat is reduced.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "じめんを　ふみならして　じぶんの\nまわりに　いるものを　こうげきする。\nあいての　すばやさを　さげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "땅을 힘껏 밟아 자신의\n주위에 있는 포켓몬을 공격한다.\n상대의 스피드를 떨어뜨린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur piétine le sol et inflige des dégâts à\ntous les Pokémon autour de lui. Baisse aussi leur\nVitesse.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender greift an, indem er den Boden um sich\nherum plattwalzt. Die Initiative aller Pokémon in\nder Umgebung sinkt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Inunda el campo de batalla con una ola gigante.\nTambién se puede usar para desplazarse por el\nagua.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa calpesta il terreno e scatena un\nterremoto che danneggia i Pokémon nei paraggi,\nriducendone la Velocità.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user strikes everything around it\nby stomping down on the ground.\nThis lowers the Speed stat of those hit.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
