      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "경쾌하게 상대를 공격한다.\n자신이 도구를 지니고 있지 않을 때\n큰 데미지를 준다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "輕巧地攻擊對手。\n自己沒有攜帶道具時，\n能給予對手較大的傷害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Attaque agile. Si le lanceur ne tient pas d’objet,\nl’attaque inflige davantage de dégâts.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein graziler Angriff auf das Ziel. Trägt der Anwender\nkein Item bei sich, richtet die Attacke großen\nSchaden an.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Golpea ágilmente. Si el usuario no porta ningún objeto,\nel objetivo resulta seriamente dañado.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Attacca rapidamente il bersaglio. Se chi la usa non\nha uno strumento, infligge al nemico grossi danni.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user nimbly strikes the target. If the user is not\nholding an item, this attack inflicts massive damage.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
